  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3601.15 Licensing. A producer is not authorized to sell, solicit, or negotiate with respect to long\n\nterm care insurance except as authorized by RSA 402-J.\n\nSource. #8036, eff 5-1-04; ss by #10154, eff 6-25-12; ss by #13400, eff 6-22-22",
